sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant App as Web app
    participant Auth as Auth server
    participant API as Resource API
    U->>App: Open dashboard
    App->>+Auth: GET /authorize (PKCE)
    Auth-->>U: Login page
    U->>Auth: Credentials
    alt credentials valid
        Auth-->>-App: Redirect with code
        App->>+Auth: POST /token (code, verifier)
        Auth-->>-App: Access + refresh token
    else invalid
        Auth-->>U: Error, try again
    end
    Note over App,Auth: Tokens are stored server-side
    loop Every request
        App->>+API: GET /data (Bearer token)
        API-->>-App: 200 JSON
    end
    opt Token expired
        App->>Auth: Refresh token
        Note right of Auth: Rotates refresh token
        Auth--)App: New tokens
    end
    App->>App: Render charts
    App-->>U: Dashboard
